			"notes": "# VoidKeep v1.0.1\n\nMulti-version release with **17 builds** across all supported loaders and Minecraft versions.\n\n## Supported Versions\n\n| MC Version | Forge | NeoForge | Fabric | Paper |\n|------------|-------|----------|--------|-------|\n| 1.21.4 | — | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |\n| 1.21.1 | — | ✅ | — | — |\n| 1.20.2 | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |\n| 1.20.1 | ✅ | — | ✅ | ✅ |\n| 1.19.2 | ✅ | — | ✅ | ✅ |\n| 1.18.2 | ✅ | — | ✅ | ✅ |\n\n## Java Requirements\n\n- **MC 1.21.4** — Java 21\n- **MC 1.18.2 – 1.21.1** — Java 17\n- Forge 1.16.5 / 1.8.9 — Java 8 (source only, not in this release)\n\n## Installation\n\n1. Download the JAR for your Minecraft version and mod loader\n2. Place it in your server's `mods/` or `plugins/` folder\n3. Restart the server\n4. Edit `config/voidkeep.toml` (Forge/NeoForge/Fabric) or `plugins/VoidKeep/config.yml` (Paper)\n\n## What's New\n\n- Full Fabric support: 1.18.2, 1.19.2, 1.20.1, 1.20.2, 1.21.4\n- Full Paper support: 1.18.2, 1.19.2, 1.20.1, 1.20.2, 1.21.4\n- NeoForge 1.20.2 added\n- Forge 1.20.2 added\n- Build script (`build.sh`) for easy building and releasing"
		},
